                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "First\n\nBut to be serious, this a simple and fun platforming game. The objective is simple, get from point A to point B. The difficulty gets more challenging as you advance, just like any other game. The answers aren't always clear and have a lot of trial and error. Graphics are simple, nothing to fancy. The soundtrack isn't made by John Williams, but it sets the environment for you.\n\nMake sure you select a mouse sensitivity. It's simple, press ESC button in game and type in a number.\n\n7/10 would Johnny Guitar again.",
